  "details": "Currently it is possible for VR users to put their hands and viewpoints through colliders such that they can look through solid walls, or reach through to the other side to interact with buttons, or reach inside a closed box.  I suggest putting some sort of limit or collider such that VR users do not have this 'cheat' advantage over desktop users.  Related post: https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/make-desktop-user-pickup-ray-casting-work-in-situations-where-it-works-for-vr-us",
